            {
              "files": [
                "bench/memory/benchmarks/common/test_kit_reproducibility.py"
              ],
              "title": "Adapter reproducibility tests",
              "description": "838-line test suite covers: no adapter default points into /home or /Users, CMM fingerprints match stock/patched exclusion lists from patch 0005, resolved binaries are absolute, Graphify checkout/interpreter probes reject missing entry points or import failures, entire/graphify/cmm failed subprocesses raise, and unvendored backend selection produces kit-specific errors."
