              "description": "838-line test suite covers: no adapter default points into /home or /Users, CMM fingerprints match stock/patched exclusion lists from patch 0005, resolved binaries are absolute, Graphify checkout/interpreter probes reject missing entry points or import failures, entire/graphify/cmm failed subprocesses raise, and unvendored backend selection produces kit-specific errors."
            },
            {
              "files": [
                "bench/memory/ci/test_kit_launcher_and_patches.py"
              ],
              "title": "Launcher and patch integrity tests",
              "description": "272-line suite validates run_locomo.sh arm lists match entire_client.py backend sets, unknown/missing/buffered arm refusals exit with correct codes, and every patch hunk header's line counts match its body (hand-edited hunks with stale counts break git apply)."
            }
          ],
          "page_number": 4
        },
        {
          "title": "Documentation and metadata updates",
          "summary": "README, FAIR-CONFIG, and RUNNING-LOCOMO updated to document required configuration, verification mechanics, code-hash manifest refreshed, and trail 159 evaluations regenerated.",
          "sections": [
            {
              "files": [
                "bench/memory/README.md",
                "bench/memory/FAIR-CONFIG.md",
                "bench/memory/RUNNING-LOCOMO.md"
              ],
              "title": "Configuration documentation",
              "description": "README now documents CMM_BIN (required) and CMM_BUILD, the binary fingerprinting table (patched/stock × CMM_BUILD setting → run/abort), GRAPHIFY_PYTHON/SOURCE requirements and verification steps, and the resume refusal for buffered arms. FAIR-CONFIG explains the fingerprinting rationale and updates code-hash manifest with new cmm_client.py and entire_client.py md5s."
            },
            {
              "files": [
                "bench/memory/FAIR-CONFIG.md",
                "bench/memory/patches/0001-locomo-client-azure-ai-provider-timeouts-reasoning.patch"
              ],
              "title": "Code manifest and evaluation refresh",
              "description": "FAIR-CONFIG code-hash manifest updated (cmm_client.py c8456d70→ac2f46c9, entire_client.py 6db43dfb→46b628c9). Trail 159 runner evaluations refreshed (chore commit). Patch 0001 updated for client azure-ai-provider timeouts-reasoning changes."
            }
          ],
          "page_number": 5
        }
      ],
      "title": "LoCoMo benchmark kit reproducibility and configuration hardening",
      "summary": "This branch removes machine-specific defaults and adds strict configuration validation to the LoCoMo memory benchmark reproduction kit, ensuring that adapters cannot silently score wrong binaries or fail mid-run, and that the launcher refuses unsound resume operations."
    }
  }
}
